\par }{\i\fs20\ul Quests:
\par }\pard \ql \fi-720\li720\ri0\widctlpar\aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\adjustright\rin0\lin720\itap0 {\fs20 \tab }{\i\fs20 Window ~
\par \tab }{\fs20 This window lists all of the quests currently available.
\par 
\par \tab }{\i\fs20 Add ~
\par \tab }{\fs20 Clicking on this button will open another dialogue window prompting the user to enter a name for a new quest.  Once entered, the new name will appear on the "Quests" list and can be selected for editing.
\par 
\par \tab }{\i\fs20 Edit ~
\par \tab }{\fs20 Selecting a quest from the list and clicking on this button will take the user to the "Quest Editor" dialogue window, where the selected quest can be edited.
\par 
\par \tab }{\i\fs20 Remove ~
