\b\fs20\ul Chapter Editor:
\par 
\par }{\i\fs20\ul Settings:
\par }{\i\fs20 \tab Screen Name ~
\par \tab }{\fs20 This is the headline text that will appear on the screen when the chapter is activated.
\par 
\par \tab }{\i\fs20 Chapter Image ~
\par }\pard \ql \li720\ri0\widctlpar\aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\adjustright\rin0\lin720\itap0 {\fs20 
The file name in this field indicates the bitmap used as the image in the journal to indicate in which chapter a quest is located.  By default, the chapter images are located in \\bits\\art\\bitmaps\\gui\\ingame\\
menus.  The user can define a new bitmap by simply typing in the name of the new bitmap.
\par }\pard \ql \li0\ri0\widctlpar\aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\adjustright\rin0\lin0\itap0 {\fs20 
