This window displays a list of the updates.  Updates are blocks of text that can be edited, associated with an audio sample, and given set up with an order of occurrence by selecting the desired up
date and clicking on the "Edit" button to the right of the window.
\par 
\par \tab }{\i\fs20 Add ~
\par \tab }{\fs20 By clicking on this button, a blank update will be added to the "Chapter Updates" window and listed with a description of <none>.  It can then be edited.
\par 
\par \tab }{\i\fs20 Edit ~
\par \tab }{\fs20 Selecting an update from the "Chapter Updates" window and then clicking on this button will take the user to the "Chapter Update" dialogue window where the selected update can be edited.
\par 
\par }{\i\fs20 \tab Remove ~
\par \tab }{\fs20 Selecting an update from the "Chapter Updates" window and clicking on this button will remove the update from the window.
