\fs20\lang1033\langfe1033\cgrid\langnp1033\langfenp1033 {\cs19\super #}{ HIDD_DIALOG_QUEST_CHAPTER_UPDATE}}}{\b\fs20\ul Chapter Update:
\par 
\par }{\i\fs20\ul Order:
\par }{\fs20 In the case of multiple updates for a single chapter, setting a value in this field will designate the order in which the updates occur.
\par 
\par }{\i\fs20\ul Description:
\par }{\fs20 This is the actual text of the update as it appears in the text box in-game when a chapter or update is activated.
\par 
\par }{\i\fs20\ul Sample:
\par }{\fs20 By using the drop down menu, the user can assign an audio sample to play when the chapter or update is activated.
