\par }{\i\fs20\ul Settings:
\par }\pard \ql \fi-720\li720\ri0\widctlpar\aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\adjustright\rin0\lin720\itap0 {\fs20 \tab }{\i\fs20 Text Scroll Rate ~
\par \tab }{\fs20 Changing this number will change the speed at which the dialogue text scrolls through the in-game dialogue box.  The higher the number is, the faster the scroll speed will be. 
\par }{\i\fs20 
\par \tab Order ~
\par \tab }{\fs20 When there are multiple lines of conversation, entering values for each line in this field 
will set the order in which the lines will be activated in game.  If there is more than one line, when the conversation is activated, the first line will be displayed with a "More" button at the bottom of the in-game dialogue box.}{\i\fs20 
\par 
\par \tab Audio Sample ~
\par \tab }{\fs20 Using the drop-down menu, the user can select an audio sample to play when the selected line of dialogue is activated.}{\i\fs20 
\par 
\par \tab Button Choice ~
\par \tab }{\fs20 In the cases of shops, characters that can join the party, and buying pack mules, the associated buttons can be selected to appear on the dialogue box by selecting the appropriate button from the drop down menu.}{\i\fs20 
\par 
\par \tab Quest Dialogue ~
\par \tab }{\fs20 When selected, the associated line of conversation can then appear in the journal with the quest.  This option MUST be selected for the conversation to show in the journal.
